                    "Provide minimal public interface",
                    "",
                    "Correct Examples (proper encapsulation):",
                    "class Order {",
                    "  private items: Item[];",
                    "  ",
                    "  addItem(item: Item) { ... }         // behavior",
                    "  removeItem(itemId: string) { ... }  // behavior",
                    "  calculateTotal(): number { ... }    // behavior",
                    "}",
                    "",
                    "Encapsulation Requirements:",
                    "- Private fields, public methods",
                    "- Methods expose behavior, not data",
                    "- No direct access to internal state",
                    "- Law of Demeter: only talk to immediate friends",
                    "- object.doSomething() not object.getPart().getPart().doSomething()"
                  ]
                },
                "dont": {
                  "description": "Don't use getters/setters as glorified public fields",
                  "content": [
                    "Don't use getters/setters as glorified public fields",
                    "Don't return references to mutable internal state",
                    "Don't chain method calls through multiple objects",
                    "",
                    "Wrong Examples (poor encapsulation):",
                    "class Order {",
                    "  getItems() { return this.items; }  // exposing mutable state",
                    "  setItems(items) { this.items = items; } // public field disguised",
                    "}",
                    "- customer.getOrder().getItems().add(item) // Law of Demeter violation",
                    "",
                    "Poor Encapsulation Indicators (REFACTOR):",
                    "- Getters/setters for every field (just use public fields)",
                    "- Returning mutable collections/objects",
                    "- Method chaining through internal structure",
                    "- Clients manipulating object internals",
                    "",
                    "Refactoring to Better Encapsulation:",
